WEBVTT

00:01.630 --> 00:02.967
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.991 --> 00:04.326
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.350 --> 00:07.566
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.590 --> 00:13.150
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.150 --> 01:31.110
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.270 --> 01:34.510
=Episode 35=

01:51.510 --> 01:52.510
You're here.

01:52.935 --> 01:53.935
Wait for a second.

01:54.835 --> 01:56.475
The carrier pigeon
of the Xuanyuan Family.

01:56.985 --> 01:58.306
We're approaching Wudi City.

01:58.330 --> 01:59.460
We'd better get prepared.

02:01.510 --> 02:03.030
There's no harm if you want to see it.

02:07.960 --> 02:08.960
What's this?

02:09.635 --> 02:12.110
The clansmen of Lyupao'er
have set up a branch sect.

02:14.410 --> 02:15.635
Someone wants to kill you.

02:15.985 --> 02:17.585
I was bribed to do nothing.

02:18.360 --> 02:19.360
Did you agree?

02:19.385 --> 02:20.385
I didn't say anything.

02:20.535 --> 02:21.785
He thought I agreed.

02:23.385 --> 02:24.390
Can you do that?

02:25.085 --> 02:26.885
After all, I'm a senior
in the martial world.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.426
I've spent years in the world

02:28.450 --> 02:29.770
and I surely learned many things.

02:31.310 --> 02:33.485
How dangerous the world is!

02:34.435 --> 02:36.885
Don't you care about the clansmen

02:37.485 --> 02:38.925
and descendants of Senior Lyupao'er?

02:40.760 --> 02:42.535
The one who I owed is Lyupao'er.

02:43.135 --> 02:44.160
That's it.

02:44.585 --> 02:46.410
Her clansmen have nothing to do with me.

02:46.985 --> 02:49.060
What did Xu Xiao offer you

02:49.135 --> 02:50.845
that you agreed to
escort me to Wudi City?

02:51.635 --> 02:53.560
When I had nowhere to go,

02:54.060 --> 02:55.736
it was Xu Xiao who built
Tingchao Pavilion,

02:55.760 --> 02:58.111
so I could stay away from
the martial world and be true to myself.

02:58.135 --> 02:58.937
Over the years,

02:58.961 --> 03:00.761
I barricaded myself
under Tingchao Pavilion

03:00.785 --> 03:02.035
and never stepped out.

03:02.510 --> 03:03.506
It was Xu Xiao again

03:03.530 --> 03:05.170
who visited
the grave of Lyupao'er for me.

03:05.410 --> 03:06.410
Just because of that?

03:06.760 --> 03:07.770
It's enough.

03:09.060 --> 03:10.835
Zhao Kai would never expect

03:11.185 --> 03:13.010
the inner peace you've been pursuing

03:13.685 --> 03:14.760
is so simple.

03:16.585 --> 03:18.985
I didn't refer to Zhao Kai's name.

03:19.285 --> 03:20.685
How do you know it's him?

03:29.710 --> 03:31.335
You know Zhao Kai wants to kill you?

03:31.960 --> 03:33.635
Fujiang Armor is his man.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.260
Zhao Kai tried to assassinate me

03:35.610 --> 03:36.850
throughout the journey.

03:38.010 --> 03:39.460
So you know everything

03:39.485 --> 03:40.725
about my meeting with Zhao Kai?

03:44.085 --> 03:45.085
Come in.

03:48.060 --> 03:49.060
Senior.

03:50.810 --> 03:51.810
I see.

04:05.410 --> 04:06.910
Qingniao, there's a pigeon.

04:09.785 --> 04:10.785
I saw it.

04:11.260 --> 04:12.885
Shall we have it roasted?

04:17.810 --> 04:18.810
The pigeon you want.

04:23.710 --> 04:25.210
Is it some message?

04:26.010 --> 04:27.360
Why don't you have a look?

04:28.260 --> 04:29.260
I don't think so.

04:29.960 --> 04:31.061
Since it's delivering messages,

04:31.085 --> 04:32.085
I'd better let it go.

04:37.660 --> 04:39.450
Do you know where its destination is?

04:39.710 --> 04:41.110
It was sent by the Xuanyuan Family.

04:41.410 --> 04:42.485
Where do you think it is?

04:43.435 --> 04:44.935
I know nothing about

04:45.835 --> 04:47.195
the business of the martial world.

04:50.235 --> 04:51.535
Watch your steps.

04:52.185 --> 04:53.360
Don't fall off the ship.

04:57.510 --> 04:59.110
Thanks for your concern.

05:06.060 --> 05:07.685
How did Zhao Kai bribe you?

05:09.235 --> 05:10.235
Senior,

05:10.485 --> 05:12.761
he promised to give me
White Emperor Esoterica of Simplicity.

05:12.785 --> 05:14.386
Isn't that what you want?

05:14.410 --> 05:15.410
I do want to own it.

05:15.835 --> 05:17.211
But I'd rather own it

05:17.235 --> 05:18.235
when I'm alive.

05:19.035 --> 05:20.490
If I help him kill His Highness,

05:21.010 --> 05:22.261
North Liang Cavalry

05:22.285 --> 05:24.110
will go after me
to the end of the world.

05:25.260 --> 05:26.410
Are you afraid of Xu Xiao?

05:29.585 --> 05:30.865
I'm afraid of His Highness, too.

05:33.985 --> 05:36.210
Was it a test when you didn't

05:36.460 --> 05:37.635
stop me from seeing Zhao Kai?

05:37.935 --> 05:38.935
No.

05:40.385 --> 05:41.635
Along the way,

05:42.485 --> 05:43.595
I owe you too much.

05:43.885 --> 05:44.935
You don't owe me anything.

05:46.385 --> 05:47.067
So,

05:47.091 --> 05:48.690
whatever decisions you make,

05:48.785 --> 05:49.970
I'm happy to accept it.

05:50.210 --> 05:52.436
What if I promise Zhao Kai
not to stop him from killing you?

05:52.460 --> 05:54.535
I should deal with him myself.

05:55.560 --> 05:56.537
Like I just said,

05:56.561 --> 05:57.710
you don't owe me anything.

05:58.460 --> 06:00.135
I'm not the center of the world.

06:00.385 --> 06:01.786
Why should everyone help me

06:01.810 --> 06:03.085
and save me?

06:06.010 --> 06:07.310
You surely have a silver tongue.

06:08.410 --> 06:09.410
I really mean it.

06:12.510 --> 06:13.535
Give us a moment.

06:20.660 --> 06:21.746
Try Snakes in Sleeves

06:21.770 --> 06:23.306
and Open the Heaven's Gate.

06:23.330 --> 06:24.690
Show me how clumsy you are.

06:26.210 --> 06:27.210
Right here?

06:28.810 --> 06:30.335
Are you afraid the ship will leak?

06:30.460 --> 06:31.460
Hurry up.

06:48.760 --> 06:50.160
What's wrong?

06:50.560 --> 06:52.535
The move is a mess.

06:54.885 --> 06:55.885
I'm ashamed.

06:56.860 --> 06:58.370
But you've got the energy and spirit.

06:59.510 --> 07:00.610
Is it a compliment?

07:02.585 --> 07:03.970
After we arrive at Wudi City,

07:04.510 --> 07:06.535
I'll have another fight
with Wang Xianzhi.

07:07.760 --> 07:09.211
To avenge the break of your sword?

07:09.235 --> 07:10.285
There's nothing to avenge.

07:10.635 --> 07:12.035
I didn't intend to do that before.

07:12.585 --> 07:13.562
Since I've returned

07:13.586 --> 07:15.490
to the Realm
of Immortal-on-Earth by chance,

07:15.735 --> 07:17.370
I want to celebrate it
by having a fight.

07:17.735 --> 07:19.546
After all, there are few people
in the world

07:19.570 --> 07:20.770
who are qualified to fight me.

07:22.085 --> 07:23.110
I bet you'll win.

07:23.460 --> 07:24.711
It doesn't matter
whether I win or lose

07:24.735 --> 07:26.055
as long as I have fun.

07:29.410 --> 07:30.410
But you

07:31.660 --> 07:33.210
must be careful.

07:33.685 --> 07:36.306
I'll fight Wang Xianzhi wholeheartedly.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.930
I can't look after you at the same time.

07:37.960 --> 07:39.010
Don't worry about me.

07:39.285 --> 07:40.285
I can protect myself.

07:43.210 --> 07:44.935
If anything happens to me,

07:45.410 --> 07:46.706
help me pass on Snakes in Sleeves

07:46.730 --> 07:47.886
and Open the Heaven's Gate.

07:47.910 --> 07:48.667
Stop.

07:48.691 --> 07:49.851
Don't say such ominous thing.

07:51.985 --> 07:53.135
All my life,

07:53.560 --> 07:54.960
I haven't left anything except for

07:55.935 --> 07:58.135
the sword move and the sword intent.

07:59.110 --> 08:00.970
I thought I couldn't find a disciple.

08:01.935 --> 08:03.770
But at this late stage,

08:03.885 --> 08:05.885
I've met you and Jiang Ni.

08:11.130 --> 08:12.410
Forget it. I won't say it again.

08:12.560 --> 08:14.385
Just forget I mentioned it.

08:14.460 --> 08:16.685
It doesn't matter
if the move is passed on or not.

08:17.010 --> 08:18.460
Time flies.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.146
After another ten or a hundred years,

08:20.170 --> 08:21.866
who would care about the move?

08:21.890 --> 08:23.035
I'll let them pass on.

08:33.810 --> 08:35.290
Then I'll have nothing to worry about

08:36.610 --> 08:38.085
during the fight.

08:52.635 --> 08:57.111
(Greenery Embrace)

09:13.885 --> 09:14.970
A pigeon returns.

09:15.585 --> 09:16.410
Where is it from?

09:16.510 --> 09:18.190
The ship of the son of
Lord of North Liang.

09:27.835 --> 09:28.835
Get the ship ready.

09:30.210 --> 09:31.835
It's time to return the favor.

09:32.160 --> 09:33.160
Yes.

09:38.310 --> 09:41.210
(Wudi City)

09:54.235 --> 09:55.715
Floating down the river into the sea,

09:56.235 --> 09:57.286
the long journey

09:57.310 --> 09:58.810
finally comes to an end.

10:00.610 --> 10:01.635
Yes.

10:02.610 --> 10:03.770
This

10:04.335 --> 10:06.295
is Wudi City.

10:08.710 --> 10:10.235
What are those on the wall?

10:11.335 --> 10:13.185
Over the decades,

10:13.235 --> 10:16.260
numerous masters have come
to fight Wang Xianzhi,

10:17.130 --> 10:19.260
but no one can defeat him.

10:20.260 --> 10:21.785
On the wall

10:22.410 --> 10:24.760
are the weapons left by the defeated.

10:28.360 --> 10:30.360
Old Huang's sword box is over there.

10:53.460 --> 10:54.460
What's wrong?

10:54.610 --> 10:55.835
Why don't you play the game?

10:57.860 --> 10:59.860
I can't see it clearly right now.

11:01.710 --> 11:03.660
Is there any game
you can't see clearly?

11:04.485 --> 11:05.645
Zhang Julu

11:06.360 --> 11:07.610
sent a letter

11:08.135 --> 11:09.370
to Chen Zhibao.

11:10.760 --> 11:11.760
Really?

11:12.890 --> 11:13.890
What

11:14.260 --> 11:15.450
the letter says

11:16.035 --> 11:17.110
doesn't matter.

11:18.235 --> 11:20.410
He wants to raise my suspicion

11:20.685 --> 11:22.260
of Chen Zhibao.

11:23.285 --> 11:24.506
Prime Minister Zhang

11:24.530 --> 11:25.511
is good at

11:25.535 --> 11:26.930
running state affairs.

11:27.485 --> 11:29.485
To go in for intrigues...

11:29.710 --> 11:30.710
Really?

11:31.160 --> 11:32.160
He could do better.

11:32.835 --> 11:34.410
It's not intrigue.

11:35.360 --> 11:38.585
It's a fair move.

11:39.660 --> 11:40.860
The letter doesn't matter.

11:41.110 --> 11:43.011
The reaction of yours and Chen Zhibao's

11:43.035 --> 11:44.160
doesn't matter, either.

11:46.510 --> 11:47.810
He only needs

11:48.135 --> 11:50.330
the generals and officers
of North Liang Army

11:50.885 --> 11:53.286
to know Chen Zhibao
has received such a letter.

11:53.310 --> 11:54.410
That's enough.

11:54.735 --> 11:55.735
Yeah.

11:56.530 --> 11:58.260
As long as I'm alive,

11:58.710 --> 12:00.210
North Liang won't slide into chaos.

12:01.610 --> 12:03.290
Since you returned to North Liang,

12:03.785 --> 12:07.050
Chen Zhibao has never
stepped out of his barrack.

12:07.810 --> 12:09.490
No one knows

12:09.735 --> 12:10.760
what he is doing now

12:11.310 --> 12:12.310
and

12:12.360 --> 12:13.610
whether he is

12:13.685 --> 12:15.160
still in the barrack.

12:15.885 --> 12:17.935
As for the chess game
you can't see clearly,

12:18.460 --> 12:20.330
do you mean Chen Zhibao?

12:22.360 --> 12:23.970
I mean your son.

12:24.410 --> 12:25.410
Fengnian?

12:25.760 --> 12:26.760
What's wrong?

12:27.460 --> 12:29.290
This is what he has done

12:29.985 --> 12:32.135
on the way eastbound.

12:47.185 --> 12:48.360
The Xuanyuan Family?

12:48.535 --> 12:49.685
Mount Longhu?

12:50.060 --> 12:51.060
Yeah.

12:51.185 --> 12:54.285
Only by connecting all his moves

12:54.535 --> 12:56.760
could I guess what he wants to do.

12:57.210 --> 12:58.460
This idiot!

12:58.885 --> 13:00.490
How recklessly bold he is!

13:02.135 --> 13:04.785
He could even keep it from you and me.

13:07.085 --> 13:08.685
The pupil surpasses the master.

13:10.060 --> 13:12.660
He is the real

13:12.960 --> 13:14.410
Lord of North Liang after you.

13:16.610 --> 13:17.836
Your mother is dead.

13:17.860 --> 13:19.385
She won't come back.

13:23.160 --> 13:23.990
General.

13:24.110 --> 13:25.786
(Memorial)
The army has assembled.

13:25.810 --> 13:27.130
(Memorial)
We're ready to set out.

13:27.235 --> 13:28.485
Please give the order.

13:28.585 --> 13:29.885
Please give the order.

13:30.135 --> 13:31.826
- Please give the order.
- Please give the order.

13:31.850 --> 13:37.136
(Tablet of Wife Wu Su)

13:37.160 --> 13:40.542
(Memorial)

13:48.835 --> 13:50.186
But you still have your father,

13:50.210 --> 13:51.335
sisters

13:51.585 --> 13:53.085
and brothers.

13:53.835 --> 13:54.835
I...

13:55.210 --> 13:57.770
I'm the only one left in my family.

14:27.860 --> 14:28.960
Disarm.

14:36.060 --> 14:37.060
Now,

14:38.310 --> 14:40.110
he should be in Wudi City.

14:43.085 --> 14:45.035
He's thousands of miles away.

14:45.335 --> 14:47.060
We can only

14:47.410 --> 14:48.935
wait for the news.

15:17.735 --> 15:20.635
(Wudi City)

15:21.160 --> 15:23.311
After getting off the ship,
it only takes a few minutes

15:23.335 --> 15:24.560
to get in the city.

15:26.885 --> 15:28.035
We won't go that way.

15:28.685 --> 15:29.685
Which way shall we take?

15:30.110 --> 15:31.110
Take a detour

15:31.185 --> 15:32.185
to the west gate.

15:33.260 --> 15:34.260
Yes.

15:35.735 --> 15:36.562
West gate?

15:36.586 --> 15:37.986
What's special about the west gate?

15:38.110 --> 15:40.085
Old Huang got in the city
by the west gate.

15:44.085 --> 15:47.360
(West Gate)

15:53.085 --> 15:55.160
Is the gate unguarded?

15:56.735 --> 15:58.961
The gate is always widely open.

15:58.985 --> 16:00.311
There are no guards.

16:00.335 --> 16:02.890
Wang Xianzhi alone can defeat an army.

16:03.135 --> 16:04.511
Does the doodle look familiar to you?

16:04.535 --> 16:06.411
(The Best Goods)
Yes, it looks familiar.

16:06.435 --> 16:08.395
Isn't it the little monk
who went to Mount Longhu?

16:08.635 --> 16:10.310
He came, too.

16:11.085 --> 16:12.805
(The Best Goods)
What kind of style is this?

16:13.010 --> 16:15.146
Why don't the people of the city

16:15.170 --> 16:16.385
wipe the doodles off the wall?

16:16.535 --> 16:18.160
Wang Xianzhi doesn't care about it.

16:18.260 --> 16:19.350
The writing...

16:21.660 --> 16:22.306
Forget it.

16:22.330 --> 16:23.185
Don't mind it.

16:23.335 --> 16:24.090
Let's go into the city.

16:24.260 --> 16:24.786
Yeah.

16:24.810 --> 16:25.510
Your Highness,

16:25.685 --> 16:27.285
please let Fengzi Battalion go with you.

16:27.660 --> 16:28.666
The battalion going into the city

16:28.690 --> 16:30.235
amounts to North Liang declaring war.

16:34.035 --> 16:35.860
(Wudi City West Gate)

16:42.285 --> 16:45.085
(Wudi City West Gate)

17:12.060 --> 17:14.085
Old Huang got in the city alone.

18:53.710 --> 18:55.610
That's the way up to the wall.

19:06.460 --> 19:08.060
There are 12 martial slaves in the city.

19:08.310 --> 19:10.026
They are all
Wang Xianzhi's defeated opponents

19:10.050 --> 19:10.862
who admire him from the heart

19:10.886 --> 19:13.045
and willingly stay
to defend the city for him.

19:14.260 --> 19:15.261
Are they the martial slaves?

19:15.285 --> 19:16.285
Yes.

19:16.535 --> 19:17.710
In theory,

19:18.135 --> 19:21.010
they should guard
the five floors respectively.

19:21.435 --> 19:23.090
You must fight your way through

19:23.335 --> 19:25.455
before you get to the top floor
to fight Wang Xianzhi.

19:26.010 --> 19:27.235
Why they're all here?

19:29.235 --> 19:30.335
Is the rule changed?

19:30.810 --> 19:32.060
They're looking at me.

19:32.660 --> 19:34.730
Everyone knows
you come for the sword box.

19:35.660 --> 19:36.686
Are they going to stop me?

19:36.710 --> 19:37.506
What do you think?

19:37.530 --> 19:38.810
Do you expect them to return it?

19:39.260 --> 19:40.560
Why don't we go up directly

19:40.660 --> 19:42.030
and grab the sword box?

19:51.810 --> 19:52.810
No hurry.

19:54.335 --> 19:56.135
Let's follow Old Huang's steps.

20:01.060 --> 20:02.060
Brother.

20:02.260 --> 20:02.867
Brother.

20:02.891 --> 20:04.235
What are you looking at exactly?

20:14.985 --> 20:17.135
Before his decisive fight
with Wang Xianzhi,

20:21.685 --> 20:23.410
Old Huang had the last drink here.

20:36.485 --> 20:37.585
I need some money.

20:43.360 --> 20:44.360
Hey.

20:44.860 --> 20:45.860
Hey.

20:48.660 --> 20:49.785
What's wrong, Grandpa Wei?

20:52.410 --> 20:53.960
Leave him alone.

21:16.635 --> 21:19.261
(Wudi City North Gate)

21:19.285 --> 21:21.510
(North Gate)

21:22.410 --> 21:23.535
Are we late?

21:23.785 --> 21:24.785
No.

21:25.010 --> 21:27.146
It can't be so calm and peaceful

21:27.170 --> 21:28.746
if Li Chungang and Wang Xianzhi
had a fight.

21:28.770 --> 21:29.770
We arrive

21:29.810 --> 21:30.810
just in time.

21:36.035 --> 21:41.435
(Wudi City)

21:47.610 --> 21:48.610
What's wrong?

21:50.060 --> 21:51.360
Sword God Peach Blossom.

21:57.760 --> 21:58.850
Deng Tai'e?

22:08.010 --> 22:10.810
(Wudi City)

22:16.735 --> 22:18.360
Fujiang Armor.

22:22.810 --> 22:24.010
I'm honored to see you.

22:33.650 --> 22:35.410
Senior, don't you go inside?

22:37.610 --> 22:38.970
If I go inside,

22:39.235 --> 22:40.410
I'm afraid the two masters

22:40.710 --> 22:42.285
couldn't enjoy their fight.

22:44.585 --> 22:45.585
Yes.

22:57.785 --> 22:58.850
He came, too.

22:59.410 --> 23:01.010
I'm afraid
the city will fall into chaos.

23:01.835 --> 23:03.130
The more chaos, the better.

23:03.530 --> 23:05.110
Let's find Xu Fengnian first.

23:16.135 --> 23:16.712
Well,

23:16.736 --> 23:18.660
what would you like?

23:19.160 --> 23:20.160
Do you have wine?

23:20.410 --> 23:21.112
Sure.

23:21.136 --> 23:22.686
We have famous wine
from all over the country.

23:22.710 --> 23:23.850
What would you like?

23:23.960 --> 23:25.520
What did Old Huang have?

23:26.510 --> 23:27.530
Who is it?

23:29.110 --> 23:30.530
A thin old man

23:30.760 --> 23:31.910
who carried a sword box.

23:32.510 --> 23:34.011
He once drank here.

23:34.035 --> 23:35.160
Um...

23:35.685 --> 23:37.810
After the drink,
he went up the gate tower

23:38.060 --> 23:39.710
and had a fight with Wang Xianzhi.

23:40.435 --> 23:41.650
Jian Jiuhuang?

23:41.835 --> 23:43.410
Is he the one
who shocks the whole world

23:43.560 --> 23:45.160
with the Ninth Move, Six Thousand Li?

23:45.610 --> 23:47.090
You came to the right place.

23:47.235 --> 23:50.250
The senior had a drink here

23:50.450 --> 23:52.226
before he gathered great heroic spirit.

23:52.250 --> 23:53.107
Then he had a bitter fight

23:53.131 --> 23:54.466
with Wang Xianzhi

23:54.490 --> 23:55.536
that dimmed the sun and the moon.

23:55.560 --> 23:56.560
What did he drink?

23:57.210 --> 23:58.885
I recall it was millet wine.

23:59.185 --> 23:59.986
Bring me a pot of millet wine.

24:00.010 --> 24:00.786
All right.

24:00.810 --> 24:01.810
Wait for a minute.

24:05.785 --> 24:06.785
Young Master.

24:08.735 --> 24:09.506
Two bowls.

24:09.530 --> 24:10.530
Thanks.

24:14.510 --> 24:15.061
Eh.

24:15.085 --> 24:15.736
Put it here.

24:15.760 --> 24:16.760
Yes.

24:19.810 --> 24:21.260
Young Master,

24:21.885 --> 24:23.260
what food would you like?

24:24.035 --> 24:25.460
What did he do?

24:26.585 --> 24:27.910
He said our wine was great.

24:28.210 --> 24:29.210
What else?

24:29.810 --> 24:32.285
He did nothing else.

24:36.110 --> 24:37.110
Think carefully.

24:37.910 --> 24:39.085
Let me think again.

24:39.810 --> 24:41.290
He ordered two taels of millet wine,

24:41.735 --> 24:43.036
half of a catty of pot-stewed meat

24:43.060 --> 24:44.110
and

24:44.385 --> 24:45.610
a plate of peanuts, I think.

24:48.610 --> 24:49.810
What else did he do?

24:50.335 --> 24:51.910
After that,

24:52.460 --> 24:53.561
he just sat there,

24:53.585 --> 24:55.085
looking far north,

24:55.560 --> 24:57.235
and raised his bowl now and then.

24:57.760 --> 24:58.770
He seemed to

24:59.035 --> 25:00.110
propose toasts.

25:25.735 --> 25:27.260
Let me drink with you.

26:33.035 --> 26:34.460
Old Huang was just

26:35.785 --> 26:37.960
an ordinary groom
when he was in the mansion.

26:39.085 --> 26:40.410
He and His Highness

26:41.735 --> 26:43.860
were just servant and master.

26:45.410 --> 26:46.810
Then His Highness

26:47.185 --> 26:48.285
left North Liang

26:49.260 --> 26:50.460
and started a three-year tour.

26:51.335 --> 26:52.460
During the years,

26:54.160 --> 26:56.385
he had been with His Highness
all the time.

27:19.585 --> 27:20.906
You ate them all?

27:20.930 --> 27:22.290
I'm full.

27:23.360 --> 27:24.720
Young Master, where are you going?

27:24.960 --> 27:25.960
Young Master.

27:26.210 --> 27:27.866
You have nothing to lose

27:27.890 --> 27:29.250
by learning martial arts..

27:29.610 --> 27:30.610
No hurry.

27:30.810 --> 27:31.810
It's all yours.

27:37.060 --> 27:38.060
Young Master.

27:40.460 --> 27:41.586
I caught a big one.

27:41.610 --> 27:42.610
Look...

27:45.385 --> 27:46.385
Old Huang.

27:47.485 --> 27:48.485
Old Huang.

27:59.360 --> 28:00.635
At that time, His Highness

28:01.435 --> 28:02.761
didn't know Old Huang

28:02.785 --> 28:04.285
was a great swordman.

28:06.035 --> 28:07.560
In his mind,

28:08.760 --> 28:11.085
the name of Jian Jiuhuang
didn't mean anything.

28:13.435 --> 28:14.810
The one who had been with him

28:15.910 --> 28:17.510
was Old Huang, the groom.

28:20.135 --> 28:21.835
Old Huang was his companion

28:22.660 --> 28:23.660
and friend.

28:25.810 --> 28:26.935
In the end,

28:27.235 --> 28:29.085
they became each other's family.

29:08.010 --> 29:09.050
I won't stop you

29:12.110 --> 29:13.450
from having this fight.

29:15.685 --> 29:17.485
But you must come back
as soon as you're done.

29:18.530 --> 29:19.530
No one can roast

29:19.635 --> 29:20.955
so nice sweet potatoes as you do.

29:21.560 --> 29:22.560
I promise,

29:22.890 --> 29:23.770
I'll come back the moment I'm done.

29:23.860 --> 29:24.717
The first thing I do

29:24.741 --> 29:26.141
is to roast sweet potatoes for you.

29:38.510 --> 29:39.770
Your front teeth are broken,

29:40.635 --> 29:42.085
yet you still like peanuts.

29:43.410 --> 29:44.785
You're really bad at drinking.

29:45.385 --> 29:46.610
Two taels of millet wine

29:46.810 --> 29:48.090
takes you so long to drink.

30:00.160 --> 30:01.160
Senior Li.

30:02.785 --> 30:03.785
What?

30:04.285 --> 30:05.285
Would you please

30:05.585 --> 30:06.960
have a talk with him?

30:08.935 --> 30:10.035
Why drag me in?

30:14.485 --> 30:16.085
You're the only one

30:17.060 --> 30:18.635
who can wake him up at this time.

30:24.210 --> 30:25.335
Don't drink too much.

30:25.460 --> 30:26.735
Every time you get drunk,

30:26.985 --> 30:28.250
I have to clean it up.

30:45.760 --> 30:46.910
Old Huang

30:47.685 --> 30:48.685
was gone.

31:06.285 --> 31:07.735
I know he was gone.

31:09.260 --> 31:10.260
Senior,

31:11.335 --> 31:12.335
I'm not crazy.

31:13.085 --> 31:14.136
I just want to

31:14.160 --> 31:15.935
accompany him for a while.

31:30.360 --> 31:32.010
Want to get the sword box back?

31:33.135 --> 31:34.135
Sure.

31:34.410 --> 31:35.585
Tell him yourself.

31:35.985 --> 31:36.890
Tell who?

31:36.960 --> 31:38.236
This is Wudi City.

31:38.260 --> 31:39.580
Who do you think you should tell?

31:40.260 --> 31:41.290
Wang Xianzhi?

31:41.885 --> 31:43.306
Mustn't I fight my way out
to get to the top floor

31:43.330 --> 31:43.987
before I see him?

31:44.011 --> 31:45.090
That's his rule,

31:45.310 --> 31:46.310
not yours.

31:49.260 --> 31:50.260
Right.

31:51.260 --> 31:52.690
That's his rule,

31:53.710 --> 31:54.930
not mine.

31:57.560 --> 31:59.610
How do you tell him you're here?

32:12.610 --> 32:13.910
Wang Xianzhi!

32:17.360 --> 32:20.535
Tell me what is
clouds of the nine heavens hanging down

32:20.785 --> 32:23.435
and water of the four seas rising up!

32:24.760 --> 32:25.960
Xu Fengnian.

32:26.735 --> 32:28.135
We finally find him.

32:29.660 --> 32:30.835
Should we take action now?

32:33.635 --> 32:34.635
Wait until

32:35.110 --> 32:36.485
Li Chungang makes move.

32:37.135 --> 32:39.490
That's what you want to
tell Wang Xianzhi?

32:40.810 --> 32:42.050
Clouds of the nine heavens,

32:42.370 --> 32:43.560
water of the four seas?

32:44.860 --> 32:45.860
Xu Fengnian,

32:45.985 --> 32:47.585
why do you come to Wudi City?

32:48.335 --> 32:49.360
If you're afraid,

32:49.485 --> 32:51.271
shut up and get out of the city.

32:51.295 --> 32:52.306
Run back to North Liang.

32:52.330 --> 32:53.385
I'm not afraid!

32:53.560 --> 32:54.560
Don't tell me!

32:56.035 --> 32:57.285
Wang Xianzhi!

32:57.850 --> 33:00.235
I don't care about your rules!

33:00.585 --> 33:01.690
Today I must

33:01.785 --> 33:04.065
get the sword box back.

33:04.635 --> 33:05.885
If you dare stop me,

33:06.460 --> 33:09.170
I'll beat you up into sweet potatoes.

33:11.610 --> 33:12.610
Sweet potatoes?

33:12.960 --> 33:14.610
Did he say sweet potatoes?

33:15.435 --> 33:16.510
I think so.

33:17.985 --> 33:19.036
Well done!

33:19.060 --> 33:19.930
Got a nerve!

33:20.010 --> 33:21.010
Fantastic!

33:22.910 --> 33:23.910
What did you say?

33:26.210 --> 33:27.850
During my three-year tour
with Old Huang,

33:28.185 --> 33:29.436
what we ate most

33:29.460 --> 33:31.340
were sweet potatoes
stolen from farmers' fields.

33:31.435 --> 33:33.185
I was thinking of it just now.

33:34.135 --> 33:35.610
It just blurted out.

33:37.185 --> 33:39.260
It has been years since we last

33:39.360 --> 33:41.120
heard someone talking like that
in Wudi City.

33:41.335 --> 33:43.285
That's the spirit
of Lord of North Liang.

33:44.210 --> 33:46.010
I'm afraid Wang Xianzhi can't bear it.

33:48.260 --> 33:49.260
Get ready.

33:49.610 --> 33:51.066
I'm coming.

33:51.090 --> 33:52.610
Who wants to have a fight?

33:57.110 --> 33:58.860
(Liuchen Shop)

34:00.060 --> 34:02.690
The Second Best, Wang Xianzhi.

34:12.760 --> 34:14.035
Wang Xianzhi.

34:22.010 --> 34:25.810
(The Second Best, Wang Xianzhi)

34:26.285 --> 34:27.570
Who else could it be?

34:28.010 --> 34:29.461
I should warn you in advance.

34:29.485 --> 34:30.485
Go ahead.

34:30.785 --> 34:32.211
Even if Wang Xianzhi doesn't come,

34:32.235 --> 34:34.686
there are still 12 martial slaves.

34:34.710 --> 34:35.686
To get up the gate tower,

34:35.710 --> 34:36.710
it's not easy.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.510
I've made it this far.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.935
Is there any way back?

34:43.135 --> 34:44.135
You're right.

34:44.235 --> 34:45.450
You've made it this far.

34:45.685 --> 34:46.690
You have no way back.

34:49.310 --> 34:50.885
Swords come to me!

34:59.810 --> 35:01.910
A master, indeed!

35:33.285 --> 35:35.735
(North Gate)

36:02.710 --> 36:03.710
So many swords.

36:03.885 --> 36:04.910
You should probably win.

36:05.310 --> 36:06.386
When one achieves to my realm,

36:06.410 --> 36:08.286
it makes no difference

36:08.310 --> 36:09.461
with one sword or numerous swords.

36:09.485 --> 36:10.785
Then why did you take so many?

36:10.935 --> 36:12.235
Because it looks domineering.

36:13.035 --> 36:14.535
Go take what you have to.

36:46.785 --> 36:47.935
Wang Xianzhi.

36:48.260 --> 36:49.310
As I come to

36:49.535 --> 36:50.626
visit East Sea,

36:50.650 --> 36:51.886
I've borrowed the swords of the city

36:51.910 --> 36:52.960
to fight you.

36:53.510 --> 36:54.560
Sword God Li,

36:55.410 --> 36:56.690
we meet again.

36:57.510 --> 36:58.590
Let's talk after the fight.

37:06.235 --> 37:07.235
Hold on.

37:10.410 --> 37:12.635
Why don't we go to the sea?

37:15.060 --> 37:16.260
No problem.

37:40.485 --> 37:41.485
The world's

37:42.510 --> 37:43.970
bitterest fight.

38:21.160 --> 38:22.360
Good view.

38:22.685 --> 38:23.710
That's it.

38:26.935 --> 38:28.035
Unfortunate.

38:30.360 --> 38:31.490
With so many swords,

38:32.110 --> 38:33.735
it doesn't matter to have one less arm.

38:33.860 --> 38:35.560
It's different after all.

38:35.910 --> 38:36.910
What a pity.

38:38.085 --> 38:39.370
I don't need your sympathy.

38:39.760 --> 38:41.160
I just missed an arm.

38:41.560 --> 38:42.786
Even if I have no hands and feet,

38:42.810 --> 38:45.010
I'm not afraid of fighting.

38:47.785 --> 38:49.730
It's too ominous.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.860
Can I take back the words?

38:58.210 --> 38:59.610
The power of heaven and earth.

39:00.785 --> 39:01.850
Interesting.

39:14.090 --> 39:15.650
Please make your move.

39:16.885 --> 39:19.060
Let me break it with my swords.

40:37.160 --> 40:38.386
There is a fight.

40:38.410 --> 40:38.946
Go!

40:38.970 --> 40:39.866
- Let's go to the seaside.
- Hurry.

40:39.890 --> 40:40.636
- Go.
- Go.

40:40.660 --> 40:41.361
Let's go and see.

40:41.385 --> 40:42.385
Hurry up.

40:43.685 --> 40:44.186
Hurry.

40:44.210 --> 40:45.210
Hurry up.

40:48.210 --> 40:49.210
Over there.

40:57.160 --> 40:58.061
- Hurry.
- Hurry.

40:58.085 --> 40:58.797
- Follow me.
- Go.

40:58.821 --> 40:59.835
Let's go and have a look.

41:00.535 --> 41:01.535
Hurry.

41:02.010 --> 41:03.360
Sword God Li.

41:03.460 --> 41:04.750
Wang Xianzhi.

41:05.310 --> 41:07.260
They're almost immortals.

41:09.285 --> 41:10.835
Let immortals fight immortals.

41:12.010 --> 41:13.010
Humans

41:13.585 --> 41:14.585
fight humans.

41:31.385 --> 41:32.435
Well done.

41:33.035 --> 41:34.035
Deserves to be rewarded.

41:41.810 --> 41:43.060
Did everyone leave so soon?

41:44.385 --> 41:45.530
They all went to the beach

41:45.885 --> 41:47.410
to watch the fight closely.

41:50.135 --> 41:51.460
It's time to do our business.

41:52.910 --> 41:54.110
Please give the order.

41:58.885 --> 41:59.885
Brother.

42:01.135 --> 42:02.785
We're going to get the sword box.

42:02.910 --> 42:03.910
It's dangerous.

42:04.035 --> 42:05.135
You'd better not go.

42:06.485 --> 42:08.385
I'm willing to stick together with you.

42:11.735 --> 42:12.735
Good.

42:13.935 --> 42:15.585
That's good.

42:28.485 --> 42:32.090
Xu Fengnian, you finally show up.

42:32.860 --> 42:34.050
Li Chungang is not with him.

42:34.135 --> 42:35.135
Shall we take action?

42:35.885 --> 42:37.386
There are many people around him.

42:37.410 --> 42:38.410
No hurry.

42:38.860 --> 42:40.210
He's going to climb the wall.

42:41.135 --> 42:42.285
The martial slaves

42:42.535 --> 42:44.085
must stop him.

43:29.860 --> 43:32.610
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.385 --> 43:37.185
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.110 --> 43:42.030
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.110 --> 43:46.910
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.210 --> 43:51.110
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.810 --> 43:55.630
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.635 --> 44:00.390
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.410 --> 44:05.335
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.835 --> 44:08.566
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.590 --> 44:09.830
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.610 --> 44:14.470
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.285 --> 44:18.011
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.035 --> 44:19.470
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.960 --> 44:23.835
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.260 --> 44:25.611
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.635 --> 44:28.470
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.885 --> 44:31.366
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.390 --> 44:33.790
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.085 --> 44:36.111
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.135 --> 44:38.311
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.335 --> 44:42.550
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.910 --> 44:44.046
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.070 --> 44:47.110
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.285 --> 44:49.246
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.270 --> 44:51.990
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.550 --> 44:54.366
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.390 --> 44:56.886
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.910 --> 45:01.010
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
